# Authentik apps

List and craft applications, providers (OIDC/SAML/proxy), flows, stages, and
groups/users inventory. Prefer MCP when connected; else
API or authenticated UI.

Never invent application / provider / flow / group ids — list/resolve first.
Resolve the instance base URL from operator config — do not hardcode hosts.
After changes, report name + type + slug/client-id **name** only (never paste
client secrets).
